Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Imagine… AI becomes smarter than every human on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What would happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You ask it a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It answers before you finish typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It starts improving itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:24.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In 1997, a computer beat the world chess champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:31.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In 2016, AlphaGo won with a move no human expert expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then it predicted the shapes of two hundred million proteins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:39.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A mind like that could out-think all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:43.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And we might not understand its choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your brain has eighty-six billion neurons… and runs on just twenty watts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:52.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Today's AI needs entire data centers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:55.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You have been watching AI this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}This voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}These images.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}None of it is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In 1965, a mathematician warned: a super-intelligent machine could be the last invention we ever need.
